{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious laugh echoed from the lake on that restless summer night. One careless step outside the tent \u2014 and you find yourself dragged into a dark world of shifting swamps, inhabited by strange creatures and filled with hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.poster.avif?t=1757560265\" width=796 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.webm?t=1757560265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/77919bb9c2cfe4fda6c631bec5a7f4d5.mp4?t=1757560265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, a talking Cat convinces you to enter the inhospitable castle rising above the swamp, while the Witch from the gingerbread house teaches you the basics of potion brewing. Will you have the courage to uncover the mystery of this place?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025310/extras/2af17230ce157c619f6363aa3f94488e.webp?t=1757560265\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles, potion crafting, and location exploration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark swamp hiding a sinister secret;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many strange inhabitants for you to meet;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics.</p><p class=\"b